00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:52.560
- Don't be hard on him, Henry.

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:54.130
- You're the one who is hard on him.

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:56.960
You treat your brother like an irresponsible halfwit,

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:59.120
and then you're surprised that he behaves like one.

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:16.070
- Goodbye, Henry. I shan't forget what you've done for me. - You're so unkind to him and the poor boy's in such difficulties.

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:21.540
- Entirely through his own fault. - I sometimes think he's the only person in the world who still cares for me.

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:24.860
You were saying such sweet things to me before you came in.

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:29.890
- As the check. - Henry! Oh, how can you?

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:32.470
I'm sorry, my dear.

00:02:32.470 --> 00:02:34.660
Is this for the chemist?

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:38.300
You don't say anything nice to me because you don't feel it.

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.300
- You hate me, really. - No, Emily, please.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:43.220
No, don't even hate me. That'd be too much trouble.

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:47.110
You're just bored, bored and disgusted because I'm ill because of this.

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:48.530
