00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:57.540
Robert's just offered to take me in his car.

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:00.000
But you can't go by car. It's much too tiring.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:04.080
It's a question of being tired. It's a question of being with someone who cares for you.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.920
- You mean who cares for your money. - Well, I don't care if he does.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:09.200
At least he doesn't wish I were dead, which is what you do.

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:12.400
- Emily, please. - But it's sure you can't deny it. You do wish I were dead.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:15.080
Oh, I certainly shall if you go on much longer like this.

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:17.430
- Oh, I'm sorry. - No, no. Come in and listen.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:20.520
He's just said it in so many words. He wishes I were dead.

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:22.120
Where are you going?

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:43.500
he's forgotten janet's birthday presents go after him will you see i've been so beautifully bound

