show me the thing emily gave you isn't it lovely they've spoiled me i don't deserve it deserve

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:05.850
- In fact, Marie, spending her life looking after a wretched old croc like me. - Father, please.

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:11.650
Sacrificing herself when she ought to get married. I'm not worth it. I ought to be dead,

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:15.990
