00:54:11.390 --> 00:54:21.560
- Henry Maurier. - We now come to a rather painful subject.

00:54:21.560 --> 00:54:26.270
Tell me, were you acquainted with the present Mrs. Maurier

00:54:26.270 --> 00:54:28.280
before the death of your first wife?

00:54:28.280 --> 00:54:30.000
With all respect, sir, I fail to see

00:54:30.000 --> 00:54:32.900
what daring this question can have upon the present inquiry?

00:54:33.300 --> 00:54:36.340
You will please allow me to conduct the proceedings in my court in my own way.

00:54:37.650 --> 00:54:39.030
Will you please answer the question, Mr. Morier?

00:54:39.500 --> 00:54:43.230
I had been acquainted with her for about four months, I think.

00:54:44.720 --> 00:54:47.880
Mrs. Morier's maid has testified that after lunch

00:54:47.880 --> 00:54:50.120
you offered to go and fetch your wife's medicine.

00:54:50.950 --> 00:54:51.730
Is that the case?

00:54:52.270 --> 00:54:52.650
Yes.

00:54:53.290 --> 00:54:56.270
Did you bring it back, the medicine, in the bottle?

00:54:56.780 --> 00:55:00.000
No, I poured out two tablespoonfuls into a wine lard.

00:55:00.000 --> 00:55:02.210
and I swear to God I added nothing.

00:55:02.210 --> 00:55:05.370
