00:55:09.370 --> 00:55:12.850
Was anyone with you in the room when you poured out the medicine?

00:55:12.850 --> 00:55:13.830
No.

00:55:13.830 --> 00:55:16.350
Clerk, you have the ledger there.

00:55:16.350 --> 00:55:18.350
