00:55:26.470 --> 00:55:27.330
I do.

00:55:27.330 --> 00:55:30.000
Mrs. Fillmore's record.

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:35.100
But on the day before Mrs. Maurier died, you purchased a tin of weed killer.

00:55:35.100 --> 00:55:36.140
Is that the case?

00:55:36.140 --> 00:55:37.040
Yes.

00:55:37.040 --> 00:55:41.730
Are you aware that the weed killer in question is a powerful poison?

00:55:41.730 --> 00:55:42.730
Yes.

00:55:42.730 --> 00:55:48.430
Shortly before purchasing the weed killer, did you have a quarrel with the late Mrs. Maurier?

00:55:48.430 --> 00:55:49.360
Yes, sir.

00:55:49.360 --> 00:55:52.590
Suppose you could call it that.

00:55:52.590 --> 00:55:54.690
Thank you.

00:55:54.690 --> 00:55:55.600
That's all.

