01:05:04.660 --> 01:05:06.280
- No, she was fully conscious.

01:05:06.280 --> 01:05:07.980
- Then she was able to speak?

01:05:07.980 --> 01:05:10.150
- Yes, she was able to speak.

01:05:10.150 --> 01:05:12.620
- Did she say anything about poison?

01:05:12.620 --> 01:05:16.270
- No, no, she didn't seem to realize she'd been poisoned.

01:05:16.270 --> 01:05:20.510
- Nothing to indicate that the poison was self-administered?

01:05:20.510 --> 01:05:26.050
- No, nothing.

01:05:26.050 --> 01:05:29.000
- Now, what are the motives for the crime?

01:05:30.190 --> 01:05:37.830
were two of them among the lowest and most contemptible of all human passions lust and

01:05:37.830 --> 01:05:46.320
avarice his wife is rich she has made a will in his favor her life is heavily insured and

01:05:46.320 --> 01:05:53.070
now to the lure of money is added the compulsion of another even stronger passion when his wife

01:05:53.070 --> 01:06:00.000
falls sick what does this man do does he sit beside her bed to comfort her does he devote himself

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:05.640
to alleviating her sufferings? No. He wanders abroad in search of low and criminal distractions.

01:06:07.780 --> 01:06:14.240
He finds a young and innocent girl. He flatters and cajoles her. He dazzles her with a display

01:06:14.240 --> 01:06:18.890
of his wealth and fascinates her by his knowledge of the world. True, he denies the fact of his

01:06:18.890 --> 01:06:22.490
adultery, but nevertheless, he cannot deny the fact of his infatuation.

01:06:24.650 --> 01:06:28.770
The unhappy invalid at home is unaware of what has happened, and yet...

01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:33.600
And yet how terrible for her are the consequences of that infatuation.

01:06:34.780 --> 01:06:37.700
Her presence becomes increasingly irksome to him.

01:06:38.380 --> 01:06:40.380
Her very existence is a threat to his pleasures.

01:06:40.700 --> 01:06:43.040
More and more he wishes her out of the way.

01:06:43.100 --> 01:06:45.900
And at last that wish is translated into action.

01:06:48.070 --> 01:06:49.310
The poison is bought.

01:06:57.470 --> 01:06:59.670
