01:08:22.410 --> 01:08:23.470
But they proved it.

01:08:23.470 --> 01:08:25.890
They proved it in these other cases, too.

01:08:25.890 --> 01:08:28.080
Sometimes it was a matter of deliberate false witness.

01:08:28.080 --> 01:08:30.000
Sometimes there was nothing more than circumstance.

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:31.000
It piled up.

01:08:31.000 --> 01:08:35.470
It all pointed in one direction.

01:08:35.470 --> 01:08:39.140
The conclusion was obvious and inevitable.

01:08:39.140 --> 01:08:42.790
And yet that conclusion was wrong.

01:08:42.790 --> 01:08:44.740
After all, the case is closed now.

01:08:44.740 --> 01:08:45.740
It can never be reopened.

01:08:45.740 --> 01:08:46.740
Never.

01:08:46.740 --> 01:08:47.740
So what's the good of talking about it?

01:08:47.740 --> 01:08:50.460
It's just silly.

01:08:50.460 --> 01:08:51.460
I don't want to discuss it anymore.

01:08:51.460 --> 01:08:52.460
