01:09:05.800 --> 01:09:07.660
I never heard her say that, never.

01:09:08.160 --> 01:09:10.600
Neither did Nurse Braddock, if I remember correctly.

01:09:11.260 --> 01:09:14.840
I must say I was very surprised when she said that at the trial.

01:09:15.650 --> 01:09:17.350
I don't know what she said, and I don't care.

01:09:17.450 --> 01:09:20.200
Monnier cared, carried a great deal of weight with the jury.

01:09:20.860 --> 01:09:24.260
