01:10:27.400 --> 01:10:29.960
What do you mean?

01:10:30.860 --> 01:10:36.910
getting all worked up about henry's taste in women it doesn't help you to sleep you know you don't

01:10:36.910 --> 01:10:41.680
imagine i spend my time thinking about that do you well you were thinking about it just now quite

01:10:41.680 --> 01:10:51.670
loudly do you ever think about poor emily of course i do after all she was my best friend

01:10:51.670 --> 01:11:00.000
and when you do sleep do you ever dream about her those are the

01:11:00.000 --> 01:11:01.560
Dreams that make me wake up.

01:11:03.570 --> 01:11:06.290
I suppose you dream of her as she was when she was dying.

01:11:07.420 --> 01:11:13.790
Yes, and sometimes I see her sitting out there in the garden,

01:11:15.100 --> 01:11:17.860
just as she was drinking that coffee.

