I thought it was the medicine he was supposed to put the poison into.

01:11:34.730 --> 01:11:36.470
Yes, of course, the medicine.

01:11:37.000 --> 01:11:38.260
I meant the medicine.

01:11:38.560 --> 01:11:39.940
I don't know why I said coffee.

