- At last, the king! - One, two. I'm finished.

01:30:08.670 --> 01:30:12.850
I'm done for. I owe you ten million pounds.

01:30:12.850 --> 01:30:15.220
- Eleven million. - Eleven, is it?

01:30:15.220 --> 01:30:18.210
Oh, well...

01:30:18.210 --> 01:30:21.440
Well, anyway, here's six ones on account.

01:30:21.440 --> 01:30:24.160
I'll pay off the rest by instalments.

01:30:24.160 --> 01:30:26.160
It's a tuppence a week until the last judgment.

01:30:26.160 --> 01:30:28.370
Agreeable?

01:30:33.450 --> 01:30:37.520
- It's raining.

01:30:37.520 --> 01:30:45.280
