Do you know what the time is?

01:31:12.240 --> 01:31:15.500
Only two minutes.

01:31:16.890 --> 01:31:20.800
Two minutes. That's all.

01:31:23.110 --> 01:31:24.050
Then he will be safe.

01:31:30.830 --> 01:31:44.980
be safe. They must have got everything ready on the scaffold. A rope. And now they're going

