01:32:07.910 --> 01:32:12.720
The door opens and there he is.

01:32:12.720 --> 01:32:19.610
There he is.

01:32:19.610 --> 01:32:23.780
Just because she was 18, because of her mouth,

01:32:23.780 --> 01:32:25.060
because of her skin.

